  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n P = (6 times 4÷2)/(8×3÷6), Q = (12÷4-2)/(4div 3×12)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n P = (6 times 4÷2)/(8×3÷6)\n\n⇒ P = (6 times 2)/(8timesfrac{1){2}}\n\n⇒ P = (12)/(4)\n\n⇒ P = 3\n\n Q = (12÷4-2)/(4div 3×12)\n\n⇒ Q = (3-2)/(frac{4){3}×12}\n\n⇒ Q = (1)/(16)\n\nSo,\n\n ((P)/(Q))² = ((3)/(frac{1){16}})²\n\n⇒ 48²\n\n⇒ 2304\n\n**∴ The required answer is 2304.**",
